# Contact form delivery through a Telegram bot — src/features/profile/contact.ts. The bot
# and channel of the old Flutter profile (bauloc_profile/lib/ui/controller/contact_controller.dart).
#
# Committed on purpose, unlike .env: every `vite build` reads it, in any checkout or git
# worktree, so the published form always reaches Telegram. (Built without these values, the
# form silently opened the visitor's mail app instead.) `npm run dev` does not read this file.
#
# The site is static: these values are inlined into the published JavaScript under /assets/
# and readable by anyone. The owner accepts the token as public. If the bot is abused, revoke
# the token with @BotFather, put the new one here, then build and publish.
VITE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=7154865819:AAEufiu0ymj3KKrXrrUL2i3CsOFn49DtGIs
VITE_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=-1002234225806
